                                "sense_id": "cfce808a-a826-3643-a604-e5c0fc92c654",
                                "text": "Ustawodawca nie przewidział takiej możliwości.",
                                "translation": "The legislature did not allow for such a possibility.",
                                "english": "The legislature did not allow for such a possibility."
